## 🇬🇧 English

### 1. Overview
This Privacy Policy explains how ZoomBot (the "Bot") collects, stores, and uses personal data. By using the Bot, you agree to the terms of this Policy.

### 2. Data Collected
The Bot collects the following user data:

| Data | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Telegram ID & username | User identification |
| Full name | Meetings and notifications |
| Phone number | Organization verification |
| Email address | Zoom meeting organizer (optional) |
| Meeting records | Date, time, section, status |

### 3. Use of Data
Collected data is used solely for:
- Scheduling and managing Zoom meetings
- Sending reminders and notifications
- Generating reports for organization administrators
- Managing user accounts

### 4. Data Sharing
Your personal data is **never** sold or shared with third parties for commercial purposes. Data is only:
- Transmitted via Zoom API (to create meetings)
- Visible to your organization's administrators within the Bot

### 5. Data Storage
All data is stored in an encrypted PostgreSQL database. Data is permanently deleted upon organization removal or upon user request.

### 6. User Rights
You have the right at any time to:
- View your stored data
- Request deletion of your data
- Contact the bot administrator

### 7. Contact
For any questions, contact the bot administrator via Telegram.

